Package: PalantiR
Type: Package
Title: Simulation and Visualisation of Phylogenetic Substitution Histories
Version: 1.2.2
Author: Ivan Krukov [aut], Nathan Escandor [aut], Aaron Mathankeri [aut],
    A. P. Jason de Koning [aut, cre]
Maintainer: A. P. Jason de Koning <jason.de.koning@gmail.com>
Description: Simulates codon and amino-acid sequence evolution along a phylogeny
    under models of heterogeneous molecular function, including
    mutation-selection models with site-specific amino-acid fitnesses and
    effective population sizes that vary across the tree. Records the complete
    substitution history of every simulation, not only the resulting alignment,
    and provides interactive visualisations of phylogenies, alignments and
    substitution histories.
